@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer README · Installation：Version **1.0.14** extends support through DSH **v0.2.1-rc.5**.
On rc.5, Firefox checks pass for PNG previews, image enlargement, WAV and MP4 playback, reload restoration, and settings display.
Host tests and live API checks also pass. ComfyUI and settings writes remain untested on rc.5.

@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer README · Installation：Version **1.0.13** supports DSH **v0.2.1-rc.2** (`latest`) and **v0.2.1-rc.3** (`next`).
We checked these npm tags on **2026-10-26**.
See the [DSH v0.2.1-rc.3 release](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/releases/tag/dsh-v0.2.1-rc.3).

@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer README · From source：1. Clone the plugin into a location available to your Web profile:

```bash
   git clone https://github.com/Wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer-plugin.git \
     /path/to/local-plugins/dsh-inline-media-viewer
   ```

2. Add the bundle to `profiles/web/package.json`:

```jsonc
   {
     "dependencies": {
       "@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer": "link:/path/to/local-plugins/dsh-inline-media-viewer"
     },

3. Rebuild or restart the Web profile.

@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer README · ComfyUI origin：Local aliases (`127.0.0.1:8188` and `localhost:8188`) and the configured origin
are recognized as ComfyUI sources. A non-empty invalid address fails explicitly
instead of silently falling back to another target.

@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer README · 从源码安装：1. 将插件克隆到 Web profile 可以访问的位置：

```bash
   git clone https://github.com/Wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer-plugin.git \
     /path/to/local-plugins/dsh-inline-media-viewer
   ```

2. 将插件添加到 `profiles/web/package.json`：

```jsonc
   {
     "dependencies": {
       "@wisdoverse/dsh-inline-media-viewer": "link:/path/to/local-plugins/dsh-inline-media-viewer"
     },

3. 重新构建或重启 Web profile。

插件通过 [`cordis.patch.yml`](cordis.patch.yml) 挂载宿主 API 路由、客户端投影和设置区域。
